      "id": "evt_columbia_bf0f2f66",
      "name": "Infectious Disease Epidemiolgy Unit Seminar",
      "type": "Seminar",
      "location_id": "loc_columbia_main",
      "community_id": "com_columbia_general",
      "description": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infectious Disease Epidemiology Unit Seminar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talk Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Safeguarding Africa&amp;rsquo;s Health Gains Amid Funding Cuts: Beyond Catastrophizing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thursday, December 4, 2025&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;11:45am &amp;ndash; 1pm&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speaker:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Catherine Kyobutungi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Dr. Catherine Kyobutungi is the Executive Director of the African Population and Health Research Center (APHRC) based in Nairobi, Kenya, and the co-Director of the Consortium for Advanced Research Training in Africa (CARTA). She is a Fellow of the African Academy of Sciences and former holder of the Joep Lange Chair at the University of Amsterdam.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5th Floor Conference Room 532A&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Allan Rosenfeld Building&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;722 West 168th Street&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;New York, NY 10032&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Refreshments will be available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also on Zoom&lt;/p&gt;",
