      "community_id": "com_columbia_general",
      "description": "&lt;p&gt;Celebrate the end of the fall semester at the &lt;strong&gt;8th annual Low Lounge:&amp;nbsp;Snowplace Like Low&lt;/strong&gt;! This festive event is the perfect way to unwind, enjoy treats, and soak up some seasonal cheer. Whether you&amp;rsquo;re looking for snacks, fun activities, or just a cozy space to relax, there&amp;rsquo;s something for everyone. Co-sponsored by the &lt;a href=\"https://www.alumni.columbia.edu/\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;Columbia Alumni Association&lt;/a&gt; and the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://isso.columbia.edu/\"&gt;International Students and Scholars Office&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to look forward to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Tasty treats including&amp;nbsp;hot cocoa, warm pretzels, and s&amp;rsquo;mores&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Exciting activities like Patch Factory: Scarves &amp;amp; Hats, winter crafts, and more!&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;A winter photo station&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Live performances from fellow student artists and musicians&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Fun goodies and giveaways&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;One surprise winter activity you won&amp;rsquo;t want to miss!&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All supplies and food are available on a first-come, first-served basis as supplies last. Take a break from studying and enjoy a festive afternoon with friends. Don&amp;rsquo;t miss out on this end-of-semester tradition!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RSVP not required. This event is first-come, first to enter.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;What if I need accommodations?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; Columbia University makes every effort to accommodate individuals with disabilities. If you require accommodations to attend an event at Columbia University, please contact Disability Services (disability@columbia.edu or 212-854-2388) at least 10 days in advance of the event.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*&lt;st