      "community_id": "com_newschool",
      "description": "Join us for our Parsons 2026 Summer Intensive Studies webinar! The Parsons New York Summer Intensive Studies team will present a comprehensive overview of the program and answer your questions regarding the application and registration process, academic curriculum, and campus experience. Parsons Summer Intensives for College & Adult students immerses students in the inspiring environment of New York City as they study art and design with Parsons faculty in this three-week, three-credit intensive program.  We look forward to sharing what you can expect from our dynamic in-person art and design intensive studios this coming summer!Browse dates, tuition, and more below:New York Summer Intensive Studies (College & Adult) Session I In-Person: June 8 - June 26 (3 credits, 3 weeks)Session II In-Person: July 6 - July 24 (3 credits, 3 weeks) We look forward to meeting you online!",
