      "community_id": "com_columbia_general",
      "description": "&lt;p&gt;Join the Center for Constitutional Governance for a discussion between Judith Resnik,&amp;nbsp;Arthur Liman Professor of Law at Yale Law School, and&amp;nbsp;Bernard Harcourt,&amp;nbsp;Corliss Lamont Professor of Law and Liberty at Columbia Law School. Resnik&amp;#39;s book &amp;quot;Impermissible Punishments: How prison became a problem for democracy&amp;quot; was published on October 10, 2025.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lunch will be provided to registrants.&lt;/p&gt;",
