      "description": "&lt;p&gt;A short presentation on the use of AI in music, its pros and cons, ethics, and copyright issues. The presentation will be followed by a discussion where the class can discuss and voice their opinions.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Instructor:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://asalaus.com/\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&amp;Aacute;sa &amp;Oacute;lafsd&amp;oacute;ttir&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;(MFA Sound Art program; Libraries Digital Music Intern)&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Info on further&amp;nbsp;upcoming&amp;nbsp;workshops in the Music Technology series, including registration links, is available here:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=\"http://bit.ly/MusicTechWorkhopsF25\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;bit.ly/MusicTechWorkhopsF25&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Questions? Please email&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"mailto:musiclibrary@columbia.edu\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;musiclibrary@columbia.edu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
