      "description": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Department of Neuroscience presents The 3rd Biennial Eric R. Kandel Lecture:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Title of Talk: Signaling for long-lasting neuronal plasticity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Richard W. Tsien, PhD, Druckenmiller Professor of Neuroscience, Department of Neuroscience, NYU Grossman School of Medicine; Professor of Neurology, NYU Grossman School of Medicine&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid event, free and open to the public&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;In person:&amp;nbsp; The Forum, 601 W 125th Street, New York NY 10027&amp;nbsp; Lecture in the Auditorium (2nd Floor); short reception to follow in the West Atrium (1st floor)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Virtual: (registration is not required)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zoom Webinar:&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=\"https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcolumbiauniversity.zoom.us%2Fj%2F97012976108%3Fpwd%3DwSaajGeNjns50Vgr4h6T0kenYOFuYa.1&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Ccad2012%40cumc.columbia.edu%7C77a1402fb7be4e55f4af08de132aa42c%7Cb0002a9b0017404d97dc3d3bab09be81%7C0%7C0%7C638969271040084185%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=oTLURKpfeDTcJf52V9d2twr5bmsd092wP6SFboDt5Ko%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;https://columbiauniversity.zoom.us/j/97012976108?pwd=wSaajGeNjns50Vgr4h6T0kenYOFuYa.1&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
