      "community_id": "com_columbia_general",
      "description": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marina Konopleva, MD, PhD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\nProfessor, Director of the Leukemia Program and the Co-Director of the Translational Blood Cancer Institute at in the Departments of Oncology and Cell Biology at the Albert Einstein College of Medicine and Montefiore Medical Center&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hosted by Stavroula Kousteni, PhD,&amp;nbsp;Professor, Department of Physiology &amp;amp; Cellular Biophysics; Director, Evans MDS Center at Columbia&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This event is&amp;nbsp;sponsored by the Herbert Irving Comprehensive Cancer Center&amp;#39;s (HICCC)&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.cancer.columbia.edu/research/researchers/edward-p-evans-center-myelodysplastic-syndromes-mds\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;Edward P. Evans Center for Myelodysplastic Syndromes (MDS)&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;",
